{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.poster.avif?t=1767974477\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.webm?t=1767974477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.mp4?t=1767974477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Chambers</strong> is a first-person horror exploration puzzle game set inside a massive, decaying manor where adaptation is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a massive manor where the room layout shifts when the bell rings. You must explore a constantly changing layout, solve cryptic puzzles, and avoid the enigmatic guardians who brought you here\u2014and won\u2019t let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to <strong>2 friends in online co-op</strong>. Work together to survive, or split up to cover more ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the first trapped here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not be the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the shifting chambers\u2014or become part of them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.poster.avif?t=1767974477\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.webm?t=1767974477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.mp4?t=1767974477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Rooms</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The manor\u2019s doors link to different rooms when the bell rings. Memorization is useless \u2014 adaptation is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Exploration</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new areas and reach the elusive escape route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manor Guardians</strong>\u00a0\u2013\u00a0 Intelligent and adapting. They brought you here and they won\u2019t let you leave. Avoid detection\u2026 or suffer the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op </strong>\u2013\u00a0Play solo or work together with up to 2 friends or split up at your own risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong> - Minimal UI, no hand-holding\u2014just dread, strategy, and the constant fear of what\u2019s behind the next door.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Support</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Fully immerse yourself in the horror with native VR support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Soon \u2013 Wishlist now and be the first to escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972140/extras/06d07dc6ae8973d5e4f62b5c1be4b723.avif?t=1767974477\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972140?t=1767974477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/39721